    "name": "Eastside",
    "instructions": "1. Add three cucumbers slices and mint leaves to a shaker.\n2. Muddle gently for 5-7 seconds.\n3. Add gin, lime juice, simple syrup, and cubed ice to shaker.\n4. Shake for 10-20 seconds.\n5. Fine strain into a cocktail glass.",
